## 5️⃣ Password Attacks & Cracking Tools

Password crackers attempt to recover passwords from stored or transmitted data.

### 🔹 Types of Attacks

| Attack Type | Description | Tools |
|------------|-------------|-------|
| Brute Force | Tries all possible combinations | Hashcat, John the Ripper |
| Dictionary Attack | Uses predefined wordlists | Cain & Abel, Aircrack-ng |
| Rainbow Table | Uses precomputed hash tables | RainbowCrack |

